====== Linksys WRT54G3GV2-VF ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Linksys [[http://www.linksysbycisco.com/DE/de/support/WRT54G3GV2-VF|WRT54G3GV2-VF]] is a 3G Router consisting of a Broadcom board with a PC-Card slot for 3G-Modems.

Compared to its predecessor WRT54G3G it has additional USB slots and much more flash and RAM.

You can ask Linksys for a link to the original firmware tarball using the mailaddress in their [[http://www.linksysbycisco.com/gpl|GPL-Codecenter]].

